  "review": {
    "gallery": "Four project 2611 Dubai Land Department photographs from the August 25, 2026 album 972859833 mirrored by Continental Club (https://continentalclub.ae/project/the-edge-business-bay-business-bay/). Six native images from the Select Group brochure depict the planned design. Individual tower assignment is not inferred from the photo album.",
    "location": "The official map link https://maps.app.goo.gl/7uujEbqU2BKDGW3TA resolves to The EDGE at 7 Al A’amal Street. The coordinates and approximate driving distances and times are Madena’s published project estimates. The original Select Group regional map gives visual context without numeric journey claims.",
    "floorPlans": "The Madena-hosted 12-page Select Group PDF gives six whole-level key plans per tower. PropJunction publishes 53 individual image rows for the two towers. Four duplicate unit drawings were omitted, leaving 49 complete Select Group-branded unit sheets. The A-03 Level 18 identification comes from its sheet. Printed total-area fields were cross-checked against the listed whole-square-foot figures. Typical unit sheets identify the exact levels even where the whole-floor key plan uses broader ranges."
  },
